<title>UK: Panama soybean carrier to be towed to New Orleans.</title>
<headline>Panama soybean carrier to be towed to New Orleans.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Panama-flag bulk carrier Megalodoxi, carrying soybeans, is at Boothville anchorage in the Mississippi with a twisted rudder stock, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The 63,822 dwt bulker will be towed back to New Orleans where its cargo will be off-loaded and repairs will be made.</p>
</text>
